an class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: What? Everyone loves you here!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I don't feel that I'm being given much recognition. In fact, I'm thinking of resigning.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Working here is an amazing opportunity. Give it more time.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I thought so too, but then having done an online test for people about job satisfaction, I realized there were a lot of red flags working here.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: What were the questions?", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le03ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "38000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: They were things like: <span class=\"italic\">Do you sometimes wake up early, excited about an idea you have?</span> <span class=\"italic\">Does your work allow you to hold true to your personal values?</span>\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I don't see how your work as editorial assistant goes against your personal values.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I value being creative at work. Right now, I am doing a lot of proofreading, but no original writing. From what I see, my potential for career growth is limited.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: No job is perfect. Having met so many great colleagues here, I know we are treated with respect.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: But how will I know if I am good enough to be a real journalist, if I am stuck in a dead-end job?", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le03ob10re2img06.jpg"}, {"time": "78500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Of course you are good enough! We have to play the game. Having been here only a few months, it's too early for us to make a decision like that. We have to prove what we're worth. Gradually, the bosses will give us more responsibility.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: There seems to have been some movement recently in the company.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Yes, I noticed that.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Remember Amanda?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: No, not really. I don't remember having met her before.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Well, she was let go last week. She was felt not to have met the standards required.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: At least you should go talk to Ms. Moore before you make a rash decision.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: OK, I will.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le03ob10re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le03ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le03ob10re2img05.jpg"}}], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": []}]}]}